{"id":"tongue-intro","title":"Why tongue twisters?","goal":"練習する音を一つ選び、短いまとまりから口の動きを確かめ、その動きを普通のフレーズへつなげる。","language":"ja","study":[{"id":"tongue-purpose","title":"難しい動きを、短い言葉で取り出す","blocks":[{"id":"chtongue-purpose-b0","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"早口言葉には、似ている音や切り替えにくい音が近くに並びます。同じ言葉を使えば、内容を考え直す負担を減らし、舌、唇、顎、息の動きへ注意を向けられます。"}],"span":[3,3]},{"id":"chtongue-purpose-b1","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"ぼやけた文を速く言うより、短い部分をはっきり言うところから始めます。ここでの練習は、聞き取りや会話を支えるものです。早口言葉を言えることだけで、会話の力を測るわけではありません。"}],"span":[5,5]}]},{"id":"tongue-contrasts","title":"耳と口で、違いに気づく","blocks":[{"id":"chtongue-contrasts-b0","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"第一言語でよく使う音の区別と、英語で使う区別は、同じとは限りません。そのため、最初は似て聞こえたり、同じ動きで言いたくなったりすることがあります。苦手な音は、人によって違います。"}],"span":[3,3]},{"id":"chtongue-contrasts-b1","type":"table","header":[[{"text":"英語の対"}],[{"text":"この練習で確かめること"}]],"rows":[[[{"text":"right / light","emphasis":true}],[{"text":"初めのRとLを分けます。rightには「右・正しい」など、lightには「光・明るい・軽い」などの意味があります。"}]],[[{"text":"road / load","emphasis":true}],[{"text":"舌の動きを比べます。roadは道路、loadは荷物や積む量などを指します。"}]],[[{"text":"rice / lice","emphasis":true}],[{"text":"急いで言う前に音を分けます。riceは米、liceはlouseの複数形で、シラミを指します。"}]]],"span":[5,9]},{"id":"chtongue-contrasts-b2","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"このほか、SとSH、THとF、語尾、続く子音、リズムも扱います。一度に全部を直そうとせず、今練習する違いを一つ選びましょう。"}],"span":[11,11]}]},{"id":"tongue-collection","title":"それぞれの句には、練習する理由がある","blocks":[{"id":"chtongue-collection-b0","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"下の英語は、既存の練習句と同じものです。日本語は内容をつかむための助けです。音声のカタカナ表記として読まないでください。"}],"span":[3,3]},{"id":"chtongue-collection-b1","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"句の意味を理解し、録音がある場合は聞いて、練習する音へ注意を向けます。Practiceでは、短い部分からつなげられます。"}],"span":[5,5]},{"id":"chtongue-collection-b2","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"音の違いを確かめる","emphasis":true}],"span":[7,7]},{"type":"twisterReference","id":"red-lorry","blocks":[{"id":"chred-lorry-b0","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"01 RとLの切り替え","emphasis":true}],"span":[3,3]},{"id":"chred-lorry-b1","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"Red lorry, yellow lorry.","emphasis":true}],"span":[5,5]},{"id":"chred-lorry-b2","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"意味:","emphasis":true},{"text":" 赤いトラック、黄色いトラック。"}],"span":[7,7]},{"id":"chred-lorry-b3","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"口と耳の目印:","emphasis":true},{"text":" Lでは、舌先を上の前歯のすぐ後ろの盛り上がりへ触れさせます。アメリカ英語のRでは、日本語のラ行のように、そこを舌先で短くたたく動きにしないようにします。Rの舌の形には複数の作り方があるので、「必ず舌を巻く」とは決めません。"}],"span":[9,9]},{"id":"chred-lorry-b4","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"lorryは主にイギリス英語で使う語です。この定番の練習句は残しますが、アメリカ英語の日常語としてはtruckを使う場面が多くあります。"}],"span":[11,11]},{"id":"chred-lorry-b5","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"短い部分からつなげる:","emphasis":true}],"span":[13,13]},{"id":"chred-lorry-b6","type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"number":null,"runs":[{"text":"lorry","emphasis":true}]},{"number":null,"runs":[{"text":"yellow lorry","emphasis":true}]},{"number":null,"runs":[{"text":"lorry, yellow lorry","emphasis":true}]},{"number":null,"runs":[{"text":"Red lorry, yellow lorry.","emphasis":true}]}],"span":[15,18]},{"id":"chred-lorry-b7","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"別の短い句でも比べる:","emphasis":true}],"span":[20,20]},{"id":"chred-lorry-b8","type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"number":null,"runs":[{"text":"I really like it.","emphasis":true},{"text":" — とても気に入っています。"}]},{"number":null,"runs":[{"text":"Turn left at the light.","emphasis":true},{"text":" — 信号のところを左へ曲がってください。"}]}],"span":[22,23]}]},{"type":"twisterReference","id":"seashells","blocks":[{"id":"chseashells-b0","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"02 SとSHの切り替え","emphasis":true}],"span":[3,3]},{"id":"chseashells-b1","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"She sells seashells by the seashore.","emphasis":true}],"span":[5,5]},{"id":"chseashells-b2","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"意味:","emphasis":true},{"text":" 彼女は海辺で貝殻を売っています。"}],"span":[7,7]},{"id":"chseashells-b3","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"口と耳の目印:","emphasis":true},{"text":" S /s/では、細い隙間を通る息に注意します。SH /ʃ/では、舌を少し後ろへ動かし、唇も少し丸めて比べます。同じ音へまとめず、変わるところを短く試しましょう。"}],"span":[9,9]},{"id":"chseashells-b4","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"sellsとshellsの違いを確かめます。単語の終わりの音も、お手本と比べます。"}],"span":[11,11]},{"id":"chseashells-b5","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"短い部分からつなげる:","emphasis":true}],"span":[13,13]},{"id":"chseashells-b6","type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"number":null,"runs":[{"text":"shells","emphasis":true}]},{"number":null,"runs":[{"text":"seashells","emphasis":true}]},{"number":null,"runs":[{"text":"sells seashells","emphasis":true}]},{"number":null,"runs":[{"text":"She sells seashells","emphasis":true}]},{"number":null,"runs":[{"text":"She sells seashells by the seashore.","emphasis":true}]}],"span":[15,19]},{"id":"chseashells-b7","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"別の短い句でも比べる:","emphasis":true}],"span":[21,21]},{"id":"chseashells-b8","type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"number":null,"runs":[{"text":"She said so.","emphasis":true},{"text":" — 彼女はそう言いました。"}]},{"number":null,"runs":[{"text":"Show me the shop.","emphasis":true},{"text":" — その店を見せてください。"}]}],"span":[23,24]}]},{"type":"twisterReference","id":"free-throws","blocks":[{"id":"chfree-throws-b0","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"03 THとFの切り替え","emphasis":true}],"span":[3,3]},{"id":"chfree-throws-b1","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"Three free throws.","emphasis":true}],"span":[5,5]},{"id":"chfree-throws-b2","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"意味:","emphasis":true},{"text":" フリースロー三本。"}],"span":[7,7]},{"id":"chfree-throws-b3","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"口と耳の目印:","emphasis":true},{"text":" ここでのTH /θ/は、舌先を前歯の間、または上の前歯の裏側へ軽く近づけ、息を通します。F /f/は、下唇と上の前歯を軽く近づけて息を通します。舌で作る音と、唇で作る音を分けます。"}],"span":[9,9]},{"id":"chfree-throws-b4","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"free throwsは、バスケットボールのフリースローを指します。THとFだけでなく、続くRへ移るところもゆっくり確かめます。"}],"span":[11,11]},{"id":"chfree-throws-b5","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"短い部分からつなげる:","emphasis":true}],"span":[13,13]},{"id":"chfree-throws-b6","type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"number":null,"runs":[{"text":"throws","emphasis":true}]},{"number":null,"runs":[{"text":"free throws","emphasis":true}]},{"number":null,"runs":[{"text":"three free throws.","emphasis":true}]}],"span":[15,17]},{"id":"chfree-throws-b7","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"別の短い句でも比べる:","emphasis":true}],"span":[19,19]},{"id":"chfree-throws-b8","type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"number":null,"runs":[{"text":"Three friends.","emphasis":true},{"text":" — 友人が三人。"}]},{"number":null,"runs":[{"text":"Feel the difference.","emphasis":true},{"text":" — 違いを感じてみてください。"}]}],"span":[21,22]},{"id":"chfree-throws-b9","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"子音と語尾を確かめる","emphasis":true}],"span":[24,24]}]},{"type":"twisterReference","id":"peter-piper","blocks":[{"id":"chpeter-piper-b0","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"04 Pと、余分な母音を足さない語尾","emphasis":true}],"span":[3,3]},{"id":"chpeter-piper-b1","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"Peter Piper picked a peck of pickled peppers.","emphasis":true}],"span":[5,5]},{"id":"chpeter-piper-b2","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"意味:","emphasis":true},{"text":" ピーター・パイパーが、漬けた唐辛子を一ます分取りました。"}],"span":[7,7]},{"id":"chpeter-piper-b3","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"口と耳の目印:","emphasis":true},{"text":" P /p/では、唇を閉じてから開きます。必要以上に息を吹かず、単語の後ろへ余分な母音を加えないようにします。peppersから少しずつ前へ伸ばしてみます。"}],"span":[9,9]},{"id":"chpeter-piper-b4","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"peckは量の単位です。この文は、Pの並びを練習するための言葉遊びです。量や内容を、日常の買い物の定型句として暗記する必要はありません。"}],"span":[11,11]},{"id":"chpeter-piper-b5","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"短い部分からつなげる:","emphasis":true}],"span":[13,13]},{"id":"chpeter-piper-b6","type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"number":null,"runs":[{"text":"peppers","emphasis":true}]},{"number":null,"runs":[{"text":"pickled peppers","emphasis":true}]},{"number":null,"runs":[{"text":"a peck of pickled peppers","emphasis":true}]},{"number":null,"runs":[{"text":"picked a peck of pickled peppers","emphasis":true}]},{"number":null,"runs":[{"text":"Peter Piper picked a peck of pickled peppers.","emphasis":true}]}],"span":[15,19]},{"id":"chpeter-piper-b7","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"別の短い句でも比べる:","emphasis":true}],"span":[21,21]},{"id":"chpeter-piper-b8","type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"number":null,"runs":[{"text":"Pick a paper.","emphasis":true},{"text":" — 紙を選んでください。paperが何を指すかは場面で変わります。"}]},{"number":null,"runs":[{"text":"Please pass the pepper.","emphasis":true},{"text":" — こしょうを取ってください。"}]}],"span":[23,24]}]},{"type":"twisterReference","id":"big-black-bug","blocks":[{"id":"chbig-black-bug-b0","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"05 Bと単語の終わり","emphasis":true}],"span":[3,3]},{"id":"chbig-black-bug-b1","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"A big black bug bit a big black bear.","emphasis":true}],"span":[5,5]},{"id":"chbig-black-bug-b2","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"意味:","emphasis":true},{"text":" 大きな黒い虫が、大きな黒い熊をかみました。"}],"span":[7,7]},{"id":"chbig-black-bug-b3","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"口と耳の目印:","emphasis":true},{"text":" B /b/の唇の開閉と、単語の終わりへ注意を向けます。big、black、bugを一つずつ確かめ、語尾へ母音を足さずにつなげます。"}],"span":[9,9]},{"id":"chbig-black-bug-b4","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"語尾をはっきりさせることは、すべての子音を強く破裂させることではありません。閉じたまま終わる音もあります。まずお手本の終わり方を比べます。"}],"span":[11,11]},{"id":"chbig-black-bug-b5","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"短い部分からつなげる:","emphasis":true}],"span":[13,13]},{"id":"chbig-black-bug-b6","type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"number":null,"runs":[{"text":"bug","emphasis":true}]},{"number":null,"runs":[{"text":"black bug","emphasis":true}]},{"number":null,"runs":[{"text":"big black bug","emphasis":true}]},{"number":null,"runs":[{"text":"a big black bug","emphasis":true}]},{"number":null,"runs":[{"text":"A big black bug bit a big black bear.","emphasis":true}]}],"span":[15,19]},{"id":"chbig-black-bug-b7","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"別の短い句でも比べる:","emphasis":true}],"span":[21,21]},{"id":"chbig-black-bug-b8","type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"number":null,"runs":[{"text":"A big blue bag.","emphasis":true},{"text":" — 大きな青いかばん。"}]},{"number":null,"runs":[{"text":"Bob bought a book.","emphasis":true},{"text":" — ボブは本を買いました。"}]}],"span":[23,24]}]},{"type":"twisterReference","id":"two-witches","blocks":[{"id":"chtwo-witches-b0","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"06 WとCHを、長い文でも保つ","emphasis":true}],"span":[3,3]},{"id":"chtwo-witches-b1","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"If two witches were watching two watches, which witch would watch which watch?","emphasis":true}],"span":[5,5]},{"id":"chtwo-witches-b2","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"意味:","emphasis":true},{"text":" 二人の魔女が二つの時計を見ているとしたら、どの魔女がどの時計を見るのでしょうか。"}],"span":[7,7]},{"id":"chtwo-witches-b3","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"口と耳の目印:","emphasis":true},{"text":" W /w/では唇を丸め、次の母音へ動かします。CH /tʃ/では、いったん息を止めたあと、短い摩擦音へつなげます。witchとwatch、whichの切り替えを確かめます。"}],"span":[9,9]},{"id":"chtwo-witches-b4","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"長い文なので、内容を一度理解してから短いまとまりに分けます。最後まで一息で速く言うことが目標ではありません。"}],"span":[11,11]},{"id":"chtwo-witches-b5","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"短い部分からつなげる:","emphasis":true}],"span":[13,13]},{"id":"chtwo-witches-b6","type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"number":null,"runs":[{"text":"watches","emphasis":true}]},{"number":null,"runs":[{"text":"two watches","emphasis":true}]},{"number":null,"runs":[{"text":"watch which watch","emphasis":true}]},{"number":null,"runs":[{"text":"which witch would watch which watch","emphasis":true}]},{"number":null,"runs":[{"text":"If two witches were watching two watches, which witch would watch which watch?","emphasis":true}]}],"span":[15,19]},{"id":"chtwo-witches-b7","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"別の短い句でも比べる:","emphasis":true}],"span":[21,21]},{"id":"chtwo-witches-b8","type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"number":null,"runs":[{"text":"Which way?","emphasis":true},{"text":" — どちらの道ですか。"}]},{"number":null,"runs":[{"text":"Watch this.","emphasis":true},{"text":" — これを